    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlkhFi0xIrlxozKypsBluMXtnhPJ1bw9nrUa90vWN2n-9yBjKJgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "In the mood for cheese spinach lamb curry, they don’t have it in the menu, only the vegetarian option, the chef made an exception and made one for us. The garlic Nan was super yummy. Enjoy the food here.",
        "time": 1766363983,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tandogan Isliel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108775439815511184993/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWA5FSmrAT2kc54_17eZafVsQp9eLrhogEdiHeSkMI0iMZR6NBy=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "The food at Punjab Canteen is fantastic! We ordered the non-veg thali, which came with a generous piece of freshly made naan bread—soft, warm, and perfect for scooping up the flavorful curries. The gulab jamun was sweet and melt-in-your-mouth delicious, and the cardamom tea was the perfect aromatic finish to the meal. Every dish was fresh, well-spiced, and full of authentic Punjabi flavors.\n\nBeyond the food, the service was outstanding—our server was friendly, patient, and knowledgeable, answering all our questions with a smile. The restaurant itself is spacious and clean, with enough room to comfortably seat large groups or families.\n\nWith fair prices and such quality, I’ll definitely be back! Highly recommend for anyone craving hearty, delicious Punjabi cuisine. A must-try!",
        "time": 1745107865,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rakshya Adhikari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112434358745011156998/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUhgyWrwsK5fzh40aAEt-5y9pctW7TaKdPdfq_OiHCisiP84tsS=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Hi Everyone!\nWe just had dinner at this location and the food is amazing. The girl with long hair that served us tonight ( I forgot to ask her name) was an amazing host and very sweet. I had noodle burger and the lettuce was crisp and amazingly fresh. We are definitely coming back.",
        "time": 1769738772,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kirtpal Wahla",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117935702869872846088/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKZuoaq13mvSGpr_UUyIWm6n9lxpzGD2RJt8jpe2WGcMNgqTNE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I bought pizza and noodles from Punjab Canteen today, they were so useless, I can't say anything better than this, the rickshaw vendor in Punjab makes them. If any of my brothers and sisters want to buy pizza and noodles, don't waste your money with them, go and buy from someone else.",
        "time": 1767921343,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "JIND AALA JAAT",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108099084398522514524/reviews",
